      "kind": "lemma",
      "statement": {
        "text": "In R=Q[a,b]/(a^3,b^3), L v=0, v^2=3a^2b^2, and (La,Lb,v) is a Q-basis of degree-four classes with determinant 3 in the basis (a^2,ab,b^2). This is a specific quotient-ring calculation, not the Hodge conjecture for arbitrary varieties.",
